 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Frozen ones: thaw them in the fridge overnight. Many are sold already cleaned — then go straight to the salt rub.</li><li>With kitchen scissors, snip across just behind the eyes, where the head joins the body.</li><li>Push the top of the head with a chopstick to turn it inside out, pull away the innards, then turn it back the right way out.</li><li>Snip out the eyes, and squeeze the small hard beak out from the centre of the tentacles.</li></ul>",
