     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"1\" data-f=\"slice|slices\" data-n=\"1\">1 slice</span> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"14\">14 g</span>)",
     "name_html": "Ginger"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Put the rice in the rice cooker and add:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>dashi <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"320\">320 ml</span></span></li><li>light soy sauce (usukuchi) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span></span></li><li>mirin <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span></span></li><li>sake <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span></span></li><li>salt <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"3\">3 g</span></span></li></ul></li><li>Stir once, then scatter <b>half</b> the chopped octopus and the ginger on top. Don't stir them in.</li><li>Cook on the normal setting.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
