  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Put the other half of the chopped octopus in the small saucepan with cold water to cover.</li><li>Bring it up slowly over <b>low</b> heat, about 10 minutes, until the pieces turn pink and opaque. Don't let it boil hard — that's what makes octopus rubbery.</li><li>Drain.</li></ul>",
