     "name_html": "Water"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Take off the drop lid and turn the heat up to medium-high.</li><li>Spoon the sauce over and stir until it's syrupy and the pieces are dark and glossy, 3–5 minutes.</li><li>Off the heat. Leave them in the glaze until the rice is ready.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium-high",
    "label_html": "<span>medium-high</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-8",
